      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If validation checks fail during the patch, the rollback procedure is to use the command 'orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>' which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. This rollback is automatic if any validation fails during the live patch validation jobs, which include synthetic approval flows and samples of in-flight approvals. The patch process includes pre-patch snapshotting of audit logs and draining the worker pool incrementally before deployment. [art_fff67d92fe41, art_f893faeda15a]",
