      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. They are running a tactical PoC of NoiseGuard, a lower-cost competitor, due to degradation in Event Nexus search relevance and entity graph linking after a taxonomy change. The exact next promised milestone for Pioneer Freight is the verification of schema registry compatibility and collection of the taxonomy snapshot, due by 2026-03-22. This milestone is critical to unblock the remediation plan that includes building a shadow index and backfilling enrichment to restore search and automation quality, which if missed, increases the risk of procurement extending NoiseGuard usage and reducing scope with Northstar [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_e2727db588de, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
